    "text": "BY virtue of powers vested in me under Section 4(2) of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451), I, Pavithra Wanniarachchi, Attorney-at-Law, the Minister of Wildlife and Forest Resources Conservation do by this Order release the block of forest land of the extent 6.67 Hectares of the Puwarasankulam Reserved Forest bounded by the limits set forth in the Schedule given below and was declared as a Reserved Forest by Gazette Extraordinary Notification No. 8750 dated 30th May 1941 from the Reserved status from 19th day of April, 2024.",
